### Créer une commande valide
POST http://localhost:8082/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Alice Martin",
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 },
    { "productId": 2, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

> {% client.global.set("orderId", response.body.id); %}

### Consulter la commande
GET http://localhost:8082/api/orders/{{orderId}}
Accept: application/json

### Confirmer la commande
PATCH http://localhost:8082/api/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "CONFIRMED"
}

### Tester un produit inexistant
POST http://localhost:8082/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Bob Dupont",
  "items": [
    { "productId": 999999, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### Supprimer la commande
DELETE http://localhost:8082/api/orders/{{orderId}}

### Vérifier la suppression
GET http://localhost:8082/api/orders/{{orderId}}
Accept: application/json
